{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"goblin_hut_1","model_identifier":"goblin_hut_1","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# goblin_hut_1\n\nGoblin hut, variant 1: a crooked hut of sticks, patched hides and scavenged planks under a sagging, lopsided roof. Hostile (no team colour).\n\n- Footprint: 5 x 5 columns (80 x 80 units, 2.25 x 2.25 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -45..44, y 0..126, z -39..31 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 512, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 18, construction_0 20, construction_33 29, construction_66 34, ruined 26 (43 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 72 x 121 x 62 centred at the origin\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `goblin_hut_1_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `goblin_hut_1_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_goblin_hut_1` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `slot_door` at (0, 0, -41)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Walls and roof slabs are slightly rotated on purpose (crooked); everything else is axis-aligned.\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"floor","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-36.0,0.0,-31.0],"to":[36.0,2.0,31.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,289.0,72.0,291.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,291.0,62.0,293.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,289.0,72.0,291.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,291.0,62.0,293.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[106.0,93.0,178.0,155.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[106.0,93.0,178.0,155.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"94d0310a-3186-5ceb-a27b-ea2ea59192b5"},{"name":"wall_n","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-34.0,2.0,-29.0],"to":[34.0,82.2524,-26.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0,2,-29.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,93.7476,68.0,174.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[68.0,93.7476,71.0,174.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,93.7476,68.0,174.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[68.0,93.7476,71.0,174.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,279.0,68.0,282.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,279.0,68.0,282.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"2d387fb1-7b7a-50e9-8b65-4527aae3411a","rotation":[0,0,-0.8953]},{"name":"wall_s","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-34.0,2.0,26.0],"to":[34.0,84.402,29.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0,2,26.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[120.0,0.598,188.0,83.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[188.0,0.598,191.0,83.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[120.0,0.598,188.0,83.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[188.0,0.598,191.0,83.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[68.0,279.0,136.0,282.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[68.0,279.0,136.0,282.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"c163df59-a790-5780-a494-e5fbde6db0c